    stem: 'A 58-year-old diabetic on metoprolol for post-MI protection develops sweating, tremor and confusion. Blood glucose is 52 mg/dL. The absent warning symptom was likely:',
    options: ['Sweating', 'Palpitations', 'Both', 'Neither — sweating persists with beta-blockade'],
